<h2 id="what-to-test-with-accredible">What to test with Accredible</h2>

<p>Evaluate credential export and ingestion, pathway completion/dropoff reporting, and the source and scope of Job Market Insights. Confirm receiving-system compatibility rather than assuming that a standards label proves every exchange.</p>

<p>Use the same authorized test achievement on each shortlisted platform. Inspect issuer, recipient reference, criteria/evidence, exported format and proof. Test the receiving system, status changes, corrections and unavailable verification resources. Measure issuance and engagement separately from skills attainment or employment outcomes.</p>

<h2 id="commercial-and-security-due-diligence">Commercial and security due diligence</h2>

<p>Compare volume units, billing/renewal terms, entitlement, implementation and support, not isolated list prices. Review current security reports/certificates and their period, product scope and customer controls. Specify storage, backups, subprocessors, support access and international transfers in the contract.</p>

